      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHASFA (1) showed good speed here last time over 1350m until tiring late and finishing fourth, beaten 4 lengths. Expected to do much better third-up and with the tongue tie going on. THE FINAL WORD (2) is on a quick turnaround after a solid third over 1200m at this track seven days ago. Nice run last time and is capable of taking this out. THROW AT DA STUMPS (3) settled well back last start and never threatened when fifth over 1200m at this track. Has started two times at this course and distance and is yet to miss the placings. Nicely placed to make amends. WORKING CLASS GIRL (6) finished 3.1 lengths back from the winner last start at this track and is down in weight this time. Winkers removed for this. Has to be respected. IN NO DOUBT (5) won't be far away.",
